<BODY>
<SECTION n=1 image-layout="blank" background-color="#2D5016">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Climate tech gets </SPAN><I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">serious</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF"> in 2025</SPAN></DISPLAY>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=2 image-layout="blank">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg">The race for <I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">scale</SPAN></I> infrastructure</DISPLAY>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Grid modernization: Smart transmission networks handle 80% renewable penetration</B></H4>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Battery storage: Grid-scale installations reach 120 GWh capacity globally</B></H4>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Green hydrogen: Production networks expand to 24 countries by year-end</B></H4>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Carbon capture: Direct air capture facilities scale to 1 million tons annually</B></H4>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=3 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="cinematic aerial view of massive solar farm installation stretching to horizon, dramatic lighting, editorial photography style">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Grid transformation </SPAN><I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">accelerates</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF"> beyond recognition</SPAN></DISPLAY>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=4 image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="grid-scale battery storage facility with rows of large white battery containers, industrial renewable energy infrastructure, editorial photography style">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2 style="text-align: left"><B>Battery storage costs drop <I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">89%</SPAN></I> in <I><SPAN text-color="#228B22">three years</SPAN></I></B></H2>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="stats" cellSize="12" orientation="horizontal" horizontalAlign="left">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="89%">
        <P>cost reduction since 2022</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="3x">
        <P>faster deployment velocity</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="40%">
        <P>better grid integration</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
    <P style="text-align: left">Lithium-ion battery prices plummeted from <SPAN text-color="#228B22">$1,200/kWh to $139/kWh</SPAN> since 2022, making grid-scale storage economically viable across all major markets. Tesla's Megapack installations now operate in 15 countries.</P>
    <P style="text-align: left">Deployment velocity has tripled. California's Moss Landing facility added <SPAN text-color="#228B22">3 GWh capacity in 18 months</SPAN> — enough to power 225,000 homes for four hours during peak demand periods.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=5 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="atmospheric wind turbines at sunset golden hour cinematic editorial photography renewable energy infrastructure">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">"The infrastructure buildout happening now will define energy for the next </SPAN><I><SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">50 years</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">"</SPAN></DISPLAY>
    <P><I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Sarah Chen, Infrastructure Director, Breakthrough Energy</SPAN></I></P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=6 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="smart grid control room with multiple monitors displaying power distribution networks and renewable energy data">
  <DIV class="body">
    <COLUMNS colWidths="[50,50]">
      <DIV>
        <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#228B22">Infrastructure gaps</SPAN></B></H4>
        <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>Transmission capacity lags renewable generation by 3-5 years</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>Rural grid connections limit wind farm development</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>Aging substations can't handle bidirectional power flows</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        </SMART-LAYOUT>
      </DIV>
      <DIV>
        <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#228B22">Investment priorities</SPAN></B></H4>
        <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>$2.4T needed for transmission upgrades through 2030</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>Smart grid sensors reduce outages by 35%</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P>High-voltage DC lines enable cross-continental energy trading</P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        </SMART-LAYOUT>
      </DIV>
    </COLUMNS>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=7 image-layout="blank">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg">Capital flows reach <I><SPAN text-color="#0080FF">breakthrough</SPAN></I> velocity</DISPLAY>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Venture scale-up</B></H4>
        <P>Series B+ rounds average $180M, up 340% from 2021</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Corporate partnerships</B></H4>
        <P>Fortune 500 climate commitments drive $890B procurement</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Government backing</B></H4>
        <P>IRA and EU Green Deal unlock $1.2T public investment</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Retail access</B></H4>
        <P>Climate ETFs attract $67B individual investor capital</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=8 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="modern clean energy trading floor with multiple screens showing renewable energy data, atmospheric lighting, sophisticated financial technology environment, editorial photography style">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Funding models </SPAN><I><SPAN text-color="#00BFFF">evolve</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF"> for climate urgency</SPAN></DISPLAY>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=9 image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="diverse startup founders in lab setting working on climate technology">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B>Climate VC funding hits <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">$48B</SPAN> despite economic <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">headwinds</SPAN></B></H2>
    <P>While overall venture funding dropped 35%, climate tech investments grew <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">12% year-over-year</SPAN>. Energy storage and carbon management lead with $14B and $11B respectively.</P>
    <P>Geographic diversification accelerates beyond Silicon Valley. European climate startups raised <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">$18B</SPAN>, while Asian markets contributed $12B — particularly in battery technology and solar manufacturing.</P>
    <P>Later-stage funding dominates as investors prioritize proven technologies over early R&D. Series C+ rounds account for <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">60% of total climate venture capital</SPAN>.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=10 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="modern green building facade with sustainable architecture features, editorial photography style, atmospheric lighting">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">"Climate tech is no longer a bet on the future — it's essential </SPAN><I><SPAN text-color="#22C55E">infrastructure</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF"> for today's economy"</SPAN></DISPLAY>
    <P><B><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Marcus Rodriguez</SPAN></B></P>
    <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Partner, Greentech Capital</SPAN></P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=11 image-layout="blank">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg">Innovation cycles compress to <I><SPAN text-color="#FF6B35">months</SPAN></I> not years</DISPLAY>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>AI optimization</B></H4>
        <P>Machine learning cuts energy system design time by 75%</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Materials science</B></H4>
        <P>Perovskite solar cells reach 33% efficiency in lab trials</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Deployment automation</B></H4>
        <P>Robotic installation reduces solar project timelines 60%</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4><B>Regulatory fast-tracking</B></H4>
        <P>Streamlined permitting cuts project approval to 8 months</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=12 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="cinematic materials lab with researchers working on advanced battery technology, editorial photography style, atmospheric lighting">
  <DIV class="body">
    <DISPLAY size="lg"><I><SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">Breakthrough</SPAN></I><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF"> materials reshape energy storage</SPAN></DISPLAY>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=13 image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="AI control center monitoring renewable energy assets, wind turbines and solar panels on screens, modern command center with data visualization displays">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B>AI cuts renewable energy <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">waste</SPAN> by <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">40%</SPAN></B></H2>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="stats" cellSize="12" orientation="horizontal">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="94%">
        <P>predictive accuracy</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="40%">
        <P>waste reduction</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="$2.3B">
        <P>cost savings annually</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
    <P>Machine learning algorithms predict wind and solar output 72 hours ahead with <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">94% accuracy</SPAN>, enabling grid operators to optimize storage and distribution in real-time.</P>
    <P>Google's DeepMind reduced wind farm energy waste by 20% through predictive turbine control. Similar systems now operate across <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">2,400 renewable installations</SPAN> globally.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=14 image-layout="behind">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="next-gen solar panel manufacturing facility with advanced production lines and cutting-edge photovoltaic technology">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B>Innovation to market acceleration</B></H2>
    <COLUMNS colWidths="[50,50]">
      <DIV>
        <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">Technology readiness</SPAN></B></H4>
        <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>Solid-state batteries reach pilot production in Q3 2025</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>Floating offshore wind scales to 15 GW pipeline</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>Green ammonia production costs drop below fossil fuels</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        </SMART-LAYOUT>
      </DIV>
      <DIV>
        <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">Market deployment</SPAN></B></H4>
        <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="10">
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>Manufacturing capacity limits constrain 40% of ready technologies</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>Supply chain localization reduces deployment risk</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <P><B>First-mover advantage creates winner-take-all dynamics</B></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        </SMART-LAYOUT>
      </DIV>
    </COLUMNS>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>

<SECTION n=15 image-layout="blank" background-color="#0080FF">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">The climate tech transformation by numbers</SPAN></B></H2>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="stats" cellSize="12" orientation="horizontal">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="$2.8T">
        <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">climate tech market size</SPAN></P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="67%">
        <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">cost reduction in clean energy</SPAN></P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="15M">
        <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">new jobs created</SPAN></P>
